  "historyNote": "#2130, eff 8-30-82; ss by #2847, eff 9-19-84; amd by #4559, eff 12-28-88; Rea 301.01(a) EXPIRED: 9-19-90 New. #5569, eff 2-11-93, EXPIRED: 2-11-99 New. #7162, INTERIM, eff 12-18-99, EXPIRED: 4-16-00 New. #7264, eff 5-6-00; amd by #7520, eff 6-28-01; ss by #8832, eff 5-1-07; ss by #9301, eff 10-22-08, EXPIRED: 10-22-16 New. #12110, INTERIM, eff 2-22-17, EXPIRES: 8-21-17; ss by #12213, eff 6-18-17; ss by #12977-B, eff 1-23-20",
